# V1 (plan.md step 15): read-only verification of the LIVE placement; opens no card and changes nothing.
# platform prints the serving container's state, image ID, the MESH / TT_MESH / QWEN_C2 / THATCH_VLLM_KWARGS env the
# agent gave it, /healthz, /v1/models and one short chat, plus the serving-diagnostics tails and the agent journal.
# Read: image ID == the thin layer's ID from V0; MESH_DEVICE=P150x4 (the agent's four-card shape); /v1/models names
# Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B:tt only, max_model_len 65536; the chat answers.
# C1 as in S1. Duration: 2-4 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status platform
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
# The thin layer by its immutable tag (TS7), printed beside :latest by the status step; nothing runs it here.
C2_PLATFORM_IMAGE=zot.thatch.local:5000/thatch-serving-tt:TS7
